{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Safe in our world - Path to Serenity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Safe_in_our_world_path_to_serenity_marketing_post.png?t=1744107709\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Path to Serenity is a cozy walking simulator that takes players on a heartfelt journey in the shoes of Jim, a man torn between career ambitions and the family he\u2019s drifting away from. As the pressures of work mount, he realises he\u2019s losing more than he\u2019s gaining. Guided by his aunt Didi\u2019s advice, an unexpected trip leads him to her cabin\u2014where he may finally rediscover the path he was meant to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Path_to_serenity_separator_618_200.png?t=1744107709\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Calm, exploration and relaxing experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Overall objective &amp; length:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Path to Serenity</i> is a short, calming experience with no dangers, timers, or difficulty. Players can explore at their own pace, guiding Jim on his journey of self-discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Path_to_serenity_exploring_butterfly_trail_618_400.gif?t=1744107709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is approximately one hour long and can be completed in a single sitting or at a relaxed pace over time.\u00a0With soothing music, nice crafted levels, ambient soundscapes, and peaceful areas to pause and reflect, both Jim and players can find a sense of calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Storytelling through colour:</strong><br>The story unfolds through colour, reflecting Jim\u2019s emotions\u2014melancholic blues at home, dull grays in his joyless office, and increasingly vibrant tones as he embraces a new path in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Progression &amp; Interaction:</strong><br>Players help Jim by completing simple tasks like making lunch, doing chores, and interacting with colleagues. The story is further enriched through interactive elements scattered throughout the world, as well as dialogue with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Path_to_Serenity_Gif_Simple_object_interaction_C_618_x_400.gif?t=1744107709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Path_to_Serenity_simple_object_interaciton_story_card_618_x_400.gif?t=1744107709\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About my studio project and me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/Path_to_Serenity_-_image_about_me_game_and_studio.png?t=1744107709\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265030?t=1744107709","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744107709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/61c158f92e1969b076b0830a6d4663768f3e173c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744107709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/61c158f92e1969b076b0830a6d4663768f3e173c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744107709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_des